    {
      "topLeftX": 124,
      "topLeftY": 668,
      "bottomRightX": 686,
      "bottomRightY": 719,
      "content": "For SuperSpeedPlus USB, a port shall always preserve the DPP boundary by completing the DPP transmission meeting the length field specification defined in its associated DPH except for the following conditions.",
